---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Resources for Farms
permalink: /resources/
description: "Plain articles on websites, online stores, and email for small farms and food businesses, plus a free website self-check."
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Resources for farms</h1>
    <p class="lede">Short, plain articles on websites, online stores, and email for farms and food businesses. Written for people who'd rather be outside.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/selfcheck-promo.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Articles</h2>
    {% if collections.resources.length %}
      <ul class="who-list measure">
        {%- for post in collections.resources %}
        <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a> <span class="muted small">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted measure">New articles are on the way. In the meantime, the self-check above is the best place to start, or <a href="/book/">book a free call</a> and ask me directly.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
